Integrates ecowoods-visual-gaps-20260912: twelve teaching diagrams, three
conceptual scenes and nine share cards. 133 slots become 157. Nothing live was
overwritten — none of the 24 ids collided with an existing file.

Every figure is mounted beside prose that already makes the same claim:
pricing-service-levels above the bands table, screen-vs-sand-vs-install with its
conceptual scene under the cost figure, estimate-measurement-process above the
three steps with the in-home scene and the estimate anatomy after them,
quote-same-job-checklist at the top of the comparison tool,
floor-movement-width-vs-length beside the calculator,
commercial-accountability-loop, realtors-prelist-three-day,
contact-showroom-in-territory, corridor-system on /corridors,
job-process-six-gates on /framework, and the containment section paired with its
conceptual scene on /services/dust-free-sanding through SERVICE_PAIRS.

verify-images fails any slot that is declared and drawn by no page, so the
mounting is not optional and there are zero orphans.

The nine og-* cards replace the homepage image that /pricing, /estimate,
/commercial, /realtors, /corridors, /service-areas, /quote-check, /contact and
/case-studies were all inheriting. They were resized 1500x787 to the 1200x630
the og() helper declares, because verify-images compares the manifest against
the file header and a mismatch reflows the page on load.

No file is registered as kind photograph. The three scenes carry the word
conceptual in their captions. Nothing was added to /api/v1/media.

